{
  "key": 9314,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_PleaseFindAPartner",
      "en_US": [
        "Please find a partner from the Trainers\n",
        "that are gathered here.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Veuillez choisir un partenaire.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_WouldYouLikeToQuit",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you have not found\n",
        "a partner for your tag team.\r",
        "Would you like to quit looking and\n",
        "return to the reception counter?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, vous n’avez pas trouvé\n",
        "de partenaire.\r",
        "Voulez-vous arrêter de chercher\n",
        "et retourner à la réception?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_ShowYouToMultiBattleRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for choosing a partner.\r",
        "I will now show you to your\n",
        "Multi Battle Room.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Merci d’avoir choisi un partenaire.\r",
        "Je vais maintenant vous mener à votre\n",
        "Salle de Combat Multi.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_RileyAskTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: The partners I have now?\r",
        "Well, my {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}’s nasty with its\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "And there’s my {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}, which\n",
        "is a sure hand with {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "Would you like to team up with me?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Les membres de mon équipe?\r",
        "Ben, j’ai {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} qui assure avec \n",
        "sa capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "J’ai aussi {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}, avec la \n",
        "capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "Tu veux faire équipe avec moi?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_RileyDontTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: ...Oh, is that so?\n",
        "That’s too bad."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Bon, comme tu veux.\n",
        "Dommage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_RileyTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Ahaha, thanks.\n",
        "I’ll be waiting for you.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Ha, ha, super.\n",
        "Je t’attends.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_CherylAskTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: I have {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} that\n",
        "is very good with {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0},\r",
        "and {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} that likes to\n",
        "show off its {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "Will you team up with me again?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sara: J’ai un {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} qui\n",
        "est super fort avec {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0},\r",
        "et un {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} avec la capacité\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0} qui décoiffe pas mal.\r",
        "Tu veux faire équipe avec moi?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_CherylDontTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh...\n",
        "Too bad..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sara: Oh...\n",
        "C’est bête..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_CherylTeamUp",
      "en_US": "Cheryl: I’ll go on ahead, then.\r",
      "fr_FR": "Sara: D’accord, je pars devant.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_BuckAskTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Yo, are you looking to team\n",
        "up? Let me tell you what I’ve got.\r",
        "My {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}’s first-rate\n",
        "with {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "And my {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} is the best when\n",
        "it comes to using {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "You want to go with me, don’t you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cornil: Eh, tu cherches un partenaire?\n",
        "Je vais te dire ce que j’ai.\r",
        "Un {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} au top \n",
        "avec sa capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Et puis mon petit {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}, c’est \n",
        "un pro de la capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "Tu veux qu’on fasse équipe, non?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_BuckDontTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Huh? What?\n",
        "That’s pretty cold of you!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cornil: Hein? Quoi?\n",
        "Tu sais pas ce que tu rates!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_BuckTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Hehehe! Good choice!\n",
        "There’s no problem when I’m around!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cornil: Hé, hé, hé! Bon choix!\n",
        "Quand je suis là, on perd pas!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_MarleyAskTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: ...My {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} uses\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} well...\r",
        "And my {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} likes to use\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "...What do you want?\n",
        "Am I supposed to go with you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Viviane: Mon {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} utilise la \n",
        "capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} avec brio...\r",
        "Et mon {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} aime bien \n",
        "utiliser {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0}.\r",
        "Alors... qu’est-ce que tu décides?\n",
        "Est-ce qu’on va faire équipe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_MarleyDontTeamUp",
      "en_US": "Marley: ...Whatever...",
      "fr_FR": "Viviane: Comme tu veux..."
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_MarleyTeamUp",
      "en_US": "Marley: ...I’ll go ahead...\r",
      "fr_FR": "Viviane: Je t’attendrai là-bas...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_MiraAskTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Hi, hi!\n",
        "I’m with my {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\f",
        "It’s really good with {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}!\r",
        "The other one is my {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\n",
        "Its {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0} is awesome!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 4, 0}, do you want to\n",
        "go with me?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maïté: Salut, salut!\n",
        "Je suis avec mon {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\f",
        "Il est trop fort avec {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}!\r",
        "L’autre, c’est mon {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\n",
        "Sa capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 3, 0} est top!\r",
        "Alors, {STRVAR_1 3, 4, 0}, on fait équipe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_MiraDontTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Oh, OK.\n",
        "Let’s go another time!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maïté: OK, d’accord.\n",
        "On remet ça à une autre fois!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleSalon_Text_MiraTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: OK! I’ll wait for you!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, don’t be long!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maïté: Ça marche! Je t’attends,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, mais ne traîne pas trop!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}